 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0028/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0028</a>|2026/10/15 06:36| 06 | 203| 044| 0147| 0035| 0104| 0234|    \n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/10/15 01:36| 04 | 040| 062| 0240| 0057| 0155| 0373|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/10/15 00:12| 01 | 344| 010| 0177| 0021| 0170| 0225|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/10/14 22:36| 01 | 083| 012| 0175| 0020| 0149| 0200|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/10/14 13:36| 05 | 022| 066| 0241| 0049| 0155| 0335|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/10/13 13:26| 01 | 318| 006| 037"
